\title{Signature instance: discovery}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{ledger}

\p{An instance is #{B:\mathbb N,\ p_i:[0,1],\ E_i:\mathsf{Prop}} with independence as a hypothesis and conclusion #{\Pr(D_B)=1-\prod_{i=1}^{B}(1-p_i)}. Its proof owner is \ref{ftip-0078}.}
